# Line endings: LF in the repository, everywhere.
#
# This project lives on Windows and is documented as deployable to a Linux host
# (see docs/DEVLOG.md SOP section), and the Python sources carry no CRLF
# requirement. `.bat`/`.cmd` are the exception: cmd.exe parses LF-only batch
# files badly in places (notably `goto`/labels), so those keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary-ish files git should never touch
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
